{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57185","headline":"十二时颂 五 · 宝志","name":"十二时颂 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日南午，四大身中无价宝。\n阳焰空华不肯抛，作意修行转辛苦。\n不曾迷，莫求悟，任你朝阳几回暮。\n有相身中无相身，无明路上无生路。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}